  "description": "Airflow scheduler, DAG processor, executor and task metrics pushed over OTLP to the collector in otel-lgtm and on to Prometheus. Every Airflow process reports service.name airflow (the job label) and its own random service.instance.id (the instance label), so queries aggregate over instance. Written for odctl.",
